Contract checked in ProcessarEventoRecebidoEvolutionGo.php:
- data.IsEdit=true selects the existing transactional edit-update handler.
- Message.protocolMessage.key.ID identifies the original message.
- Message.protocolMessage.editedMessage.conversation or extendedTextMessage.text contains the replacement text.
- First content is preserved in conteudo_original; the edit does not register a new message.
- Encrypted edits without usable plaintext are ignored, preserving the original message.

Limitations:
- These two existing tests validate edit update and encrypted-fallback behavior. They are not a live paired WhatsApp end-to-end test.
- Go tests separately cover the actual protocolMessage edit payload and its uppercase key.ID serialization.
- The existing API consumer does not implement IsRevoke behavior; revoke handling was not changed in this release scope.
